  "give me details on investor's choice||None": {
    "text": "Investor's Choice Money Market (personal) pays tiered rates based on balance, as of 06/02/2026:\n\n- $0.01 \u2013 $2,499.99: 0.20% dividend rate / 0.20% APY\n- $10,000 \u2013 $24,999.99: 0.30% dividend rate / 0.30% APY\n- $25,000 \u2013 $99,999.99: 0.35% dividend rate / 0.35% APY\n- $100,000+: 0.40% dividend rate / 0.40% APY\n\nMinimum to open is $2,500.00. Minimum to earn is $0.01 for the lowest tier, $10,000.00 for the second, $25,000.00 for the third, and $100,000.00 for the top tier.\n\nInvestor's Choice Money Market (Business) pays tiered rates as well:\n\n- $0.01 \u2013 $2,499.99: 0.20% / 0.20% APY\n- $2,500 \u2013 $9,999.99: 0.25% / 0.25% APY\n- $10,000 \u2013 $24,999.99: 0.30% / 0.30% APY\n- $25,000 \u2013 $99,999.99: 0.35% / 0.35% APY\n- $100,000+: 0.40% / 0.40% APY\n\nBusiness minimum to open is $2,500.00.\n\nDividends and APY are accurate as of the last dividend declaration date and may change after account opening. Fees could reduce earnings. Available to individual and small business member accounts only, not to investment companies or financial institutions. Maximum deposit limits may apply.",
